  "decision_conditions": [
    "Insufficient information has been provided in the form of a tree survey to adequately assess how the proposed development would affect the health of nearby trees. In the absence of this information, the Local Planning Authority cannot determine the impact on trees, contrary to Policy G7 (Trees and woodlands) of the London Plan 2021 and Policy LP51 (Tree Management and Landscaping) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (LP33)",
    "The proposed development, by reason of its size, design and position, would result in a loss of privacy which would result in unacceptable adverse impacts on the amenity of the neighbouring occupiers. As such the proposed development is contrary to policies D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) D6 (Housing Quality and Standards) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extension and Alterations SPD 2026."
  ],
